  "summary_en": "Chilean Senate commission proposal justifying and outlining a 34-week project to create a national AI strategy (R&D&I&Society). It reviews OECD principles and other countries' strategies, Chile's research, talent and infrastructure gaps, and ethical, data, labour and bias challenges. Robotics appears only incidentally.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
